msgid "Increases damage dealt by a party member or self by 6% if target is melee DPS or tank, or 3% for all other roles.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s<br><if ($gn68 == 33)><if ($gn72 >= 50)><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants a <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Celestial Sign</ui-edge-color></ui-color> when used in combat<br></if></if>Only one arcanum effect can be applied to a target at a time.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar."
