msgid "For the next three steps, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Brand of the Elements</ui-edge-color></ui-color> efficiency is increased by up to 200%. Increase determined by current <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>progress</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Can only be used once per synthesis."
